^PXD(811.2,56,0)="VA-TERMINAL CANCER PATIENTS^^^EN,PL"
^PXD(811.2,56,1,0)="^^14^14^3230310"
^PXD(811.2,56,1,1,0)="This taxonomy was updated in 2021 based on recommendations from "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,2,0)="the VHA Office of Health Informatics Knowledge Based Systems Terminology"
^PXD(811.2,56,1,3,0)="(KBST) team. "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,4,0)=" "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,5,0)="The original name of this taxonomy was VA-TERMINAL "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,6,0)="CANCER PATIENTS, however the name will be changed to VA-TERMINALLY ILL in "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,7,0)="a PXRM update to accurately reflect the 2021 changes. All terminal cancer "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,8,0)="codes were removed with the 2021 update and replaced with "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,9,0)="SNOMED codes representing a terminal illness. This taxonomy is used in "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,10,0)="multiple national reminders to exclude patients from the cohort due to a "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,11,0)="terminal illness. The national Clinical Reminder Workgroup agreed that "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,12,0)="replacing the terminal cancer codes with a more appropriate terminal "
^PXD(811.2,56,1,13,0)="illness code set is better for maintaining reminder logic integrity than"
^PXD(811.2,56,1,14,0)="creating a new taxonomy. Sites will be informed of the revision."
